  85     +              ROW       Total
  86     ACT      1488.1570   18416.303
  87     COM            0.0   20751.634
  88     FAC            0.0    9805.414
  89     ENT            0.0    3732.706
  90     HOU       209.5010    9687.915
  91     GRE            0.0      1470.1
